  </section>

  <section id="anatomy" style="margin-bottom:48px;">
    <h2 class="font-mono font-medium text-white" style="font-size:18px; line-height:32px; margin-bottom:16px;">Anatomy</h2>
    <ul class="font-mono font-medium text-[#A0A0A0]" style="font-size:12px; line-height:20px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; padding-left:0; list-style:none;">
      <li><span class="text-white">Badge</span> - Root element that sets the color, size and radius</li>
      <li><span class="text-white">leadingIcon</span> - Optional icon or avatar before the label</li>
      <li><span class="text-white">Label</span> - Short text, or a single character for counts</li>
      <li><span class="text-white">trailingIcon</span> - Optional icon after the label, for example a close icon</li>
